# Keep original interview records, respondent profiles and memory banks
# available in local distributions, but OUT of normal GitHub commits.
# Source-only CI skips data-dependent tests when *all* private records are
# absent; if even one dataset is present, its complete integrity is tested.
# Do not force-add any real participant data without authorization.
# Review the redistribution rights for graded outlines before publishing.
resources/bundled_data/InterviewData_Cumulative_Refined_14/social_research/*/processed/*
!resources/bundled_data/InterviewData_Cumulative_Refined_14/social_research/*/processed/outline_levels.json
resources/bundled_data/graded_guides/**/.DS_Store
bundled_data/InterviewData_Cumulative_Refined_14/

# Private research archives
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx

# Local batch experiments contain private model outputs and respondent transcripts.
.runtime_cache/batch_experiments/
